                                "sense_id": "f77eb2d1-d9c9-321b-8842-4c938b6dce14",
                                "text": "They are all invested with the robe of prophethood, and are honored with the mantle of glory."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b329fb08-e32f-407c-8e1f-2c99d270aa11",
                                "sense_id": "f77eb2d1-d9c9-321b-8842-4c938b6dce14",
                                "text": "There is no doubt whatever that such souls were prophets, for the mission of prophethood is education, and these wondrous souls trained and educated mankind."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
